                    "sense_definition": "Having varied uses or many functions.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "This <w>versatile</w> tool can be used for cutting, sanding, and polishing.",
